  "body": "[nginx-1.31.8](https://nginx.org/en/download.html) mainline version has been released.\r\n\r\nSee official [CHANGES](https://nginx.org/en/CHANGES) on nginx.org.\r\n\r\nBelow is a release summary generated by GitHub.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Version bump by @pluknet in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1846\r\n* HTTP/3: avoid undefined behaviour with empty encoder field values by @dgprivate in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1701\r\n* Win32: removed the iocp event module by @VadimZhestikov in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1823\r\n* Control: logged errors from accepted socket setup. by @OskarEichler in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1720\r\n* Dav: restored the request URI on a destination mapping error by @VadimZhestikov in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1778\r\n* SSL: ignored EIO after shutdown with kernel TLS by @VadimZhestikov in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1788\r\n* SSL: workaround for i2d_SSL_SESSION() negative values by @VadimZhestikov in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1599\r\n* Control API: use more portable ioctl(FIOASYNC) by @bavshin-f5 in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1819\r\n* Fixed Priority parsing of large integers on 32-bit platforms by @nishat-06 in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1814\r\n* JSON: parser API refactoring. by @ensh63 in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1806\r\n* Fixed a typo by @osokin in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1857\r\n* GH: workflow to generate windows zip by @saikrishnakumarreddy in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1815\r\n* GH: request an id token and pass secrets to a callee in buildbot.yml by @thresheek in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1804\r\n* Misc: fixed \"zip\" target with GNU sed by @pluknet in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1859\r\n* HTTP/3: avoid unaligned stores in Huffman encoding by @daewoo1109 in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1317\r\n* working_directory fixes by @pluknet in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1855\r\n* nginx-1.31.8-RELEASE by @pluknet in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1886\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @dgprivate made their first contribution in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1701\r\n* @OskarEichler made their first contribution in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1720\r\n* @ensh63 made their first contribution in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1806\r\n* @osokin made their first contribution in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1857\r\n* @daewoo1109 made their first contribution in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1317\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/nginx/nginx/compare/release-1.31.7...release-1.31.8",
